<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηγορ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>accusatory</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολογικός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1426b25
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Erot.
				<u>Prooem.</u>
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κ.</span>
			<i>informers</i>, = Lat.<i>delatores</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				8
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς, λέγειν πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJProoem.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>affirmative</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερητικός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APr.</u>
				26a18
			</span></i>, al. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				26b22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>categorical</i>, opp. hypothetical, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηγορικόν, τό</span>,
				<i>statement combining subject and predicate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stoic.
				2.66
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. συλλογισμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.163
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.790
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.166
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in Int.</u>
				74.1
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθετικῶς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				4.609
			</span></i>.</div>
